  "description": "StateMint finds the state-space model of a lumped-parameter dynamic system from its elemental and constraint equations, following Rowell and Wormley's System Dynamics: An Introduction. It is a SymPy-based Python package with a web interface that runs the package in the browser (Pyodide), and an original Mathematica package.",
